<title>HONG KONG: Guangnan interim net jumps 97.96 pct.</title>
<headline>Guangnan interim net jumps 97.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   17.58    vs 10.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.9	vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    95.21    vs 48.10</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,679.05 vs 1,760.98</p>
<p>    Company name		 Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 9-11</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Food distributor Guangnan (Holdings) is a unit of Guangdong province's Guangdong Enterprises Group.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
